{"parse": {"title": "FW-01", "pageid": 25754, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FW-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/FW-02\" title=\"FW-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9B.B4.E6.BC.8F.E9.95.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"更漏长\">更漏长</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 更漏长</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Dripping Inside the Hourglass</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1660301</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cb/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2_mohu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-620220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……方才……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视野逐渐清晰，屋内的陈设与说话人的面庞随之切实地映入眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一张带有关切神色的脸，在皱纹中似乎还藏有少许疑虑。它属于正对葛天发问的男性老者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>依您方才所言，您名为燕平，此番入城是为寻两样随身物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>是也不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>略带急迫的语气正如一条缰绳，有助于拽回漫散的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>正是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>也许是奔波劳累的缘故，我有些走神。但并不妨事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>您还有何疑问？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>噢，这是根据您的描述所绘制的图样，需得您确认一番。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>另外，此两样物件，城中以往并不曾有过。恐怕还需您多费些工夫，略为叙说其来历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者将桌面的文书推往一侧，在葛天面前摊开两卷淡黄纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>便在此了。您可细细查阅，如有缺漏之处，还请直言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕平沉默着抬起一侧羽翼，压住纸张的边角，投以视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……并无任何缺漏，与我随身的骨杖及玉佩一般无二。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>这样说来，想必都是贵重饰物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>并非如此。骨杖是我平日施术所用，与那些用毛笔、酒壶、笤帚施术之人一般，只是从身边取用的寻常物件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-620210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>原来是您的术杖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者若有所思地点了点头，随即开口追问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>只是，依您所言“寻常”一词……在您的来处有许多神秘学家，他们所用的术杖也极为普通？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>且不论“毛笔”，酒壶、扫帚，乃至刀剑棍棒，竟都可用于施展神秘术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>自然。神秘学家随处可见，有何稀奇？施术不过随心念所动，又何须刻意挑选媒介？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话语中显露的差异使燕平有些疑虑，抬头望向老者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而老者也并未回避他质询的目光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>喔，大概是此地偏远，许多事难免不能与外界相同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>还望您不要见怪。城中也有许多神秘学家，我只是未曾想过，还有他处与此城相仿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>天下之大，事物亦繁多。不足为奇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>的确，的确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>既然如此，看来这根术杖更为重要。<br />城中人力有限，我会安排他们加紧寻找此物……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句否认使老者惊讶地抬起眉毛。但他很快就平静下来，再次挂上微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>至于玉佩，您也不必担心。我便说得直些，这般普通物件，并无什么人有意拿取。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>但您的术杖则不同。若不快些动作，恐怕会遇着有心人藏匿、偷占。这样便麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>两枚物件，我们必定将其寻回，原样奉还。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>多谢。我只是一时难以肯定，骨杖是否“更为重要”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>这有何难？那骨杖到底也是神秘学物品，其价值……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者察觉到燕平的犹豫，打住了话头，另起一问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>哈哈，也是我想得窄了。那在您看来，哪件东西价值更高，更值得珍重？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厅室之内仍然一片静默，仅有羽翼轻微抖动的窸窣声响，以及更漏中流水的清脆回音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>地面的石板被磨损得发白，光滑而冰冷，并不如树木枝干那般易于安稳停落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕平收拢翅膀，趾爪在石板上轻轻敲击着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我不知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>此问还需多加思量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>燕平的回答似乎并不在老者意料之中，但却使他颇感趣味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>这般，您尽可仔细思索再作回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>寻物总归要费工夫，空坐也是无趣。您不若与我闲谈，在此稍待片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>正好尚有些疑惑需向您请教。当然，您若有任何问题，也只管提出就是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>但说无妨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>这几日，城中有一位酒坊娘子不见踪影，大家着急忙慌地寻过，无甚收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>——您入城前，是否曾在周遭见过着红裙、青衫，约莫桃李年华的姑娘？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>不曾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>那姑娘有位胡商友人，发色赤红，格外显眼，也是与她一般年纪。您又是否见过？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>亦是不曾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>您——请您再想一想，分明在一座桥边——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……桥？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个字眼似乎能与记忆中的画面对应。他确实知道这样一座桥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>那桥早已毁去，不可通行。桥下许多白骨，皆是想要跃过断口的人与动物所留。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>桥的对面又是何处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>山，树，河流，将这些景物与我们分隔的浓雾。别无其他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你要寻的二人，没有理由，也绝无可能跃过桥去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他本以为，笃定的话语能令老者停止追问，也能说服自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但疑虑仍旧像一阵令人不适的细小气流，在羽毛之下穿行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>那便只有多朝几处去寻了。唉，还望她们平安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_errenbeiying1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_errenbeiying1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他记得那座桥，也记得在此处发生的交谈与离别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>桥的对面本应有建筑，也应当曾有在他眼前纵身跃过断桥的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——那身影在黯淡的木头与石块之上格外显眼，恰好是红色。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_errenbeiying2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_errenbeiying2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/42/Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_errenbeiying2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-308220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-308220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-308220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……曲娘呢？她也过去了。但她是不是，不会再回来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"619920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"619920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/HeadIconSmall-619920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-619920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>也许在别的地方，会再见到的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_guanfushinei2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_guanfushinei2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>曲娘……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他暂且将这个名字，还有这番突兀涌现的景象放置在脑海一角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者始终关注着他的举动，此刻适时地开口插话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>您可是想起了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>琐事而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>很遗憾，寻人一事，我恐怕无能为力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>这……也无妨，我们还是说回——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>——说回我的骨杖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>或许你还想知道如何使用它，它是否会对你有所妨害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>这些互相试探的问话，已经耗去太多时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>试探？不，不！这——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>无妨。我会将这些详尽地告知你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老者的脸上浮现出与他模样并不相符的震惊，看上去甚至有几分滑稽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>正如此前所说，这枚骨杖于我而言并不是多么珍贵的物件，但也有其用处，不可失去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>因此，我选择满足你的好奇。希望你听完能将它归还给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>……自然。我们并非盗匪，不会强占他人财物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>毕竟，您是此地的主人，而我是来客。我只能这般请求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与其说是请求，这更像礼貌的警示。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但老者仿佛对其中暗含的意味毫无察觉，反而是松了口气般，连连点头应下燕平的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>理应如此，理应如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>把话说开，一切便简单了。答过骨杖一问后，我也有一问要还与你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>在我看来，你的骨相与这副形貌并不相符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>——你可有假借他人身份？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>唔。你既然问出口，想必已有答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>待你说完，我定会给出交待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他微微颔首，朝燕平做了个手势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-620201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"129\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">里正：</div><div>请吧。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FW-01"}}